<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2005/2/eng@/~cl_11> <https://schema.org/text> "The principal Act is amended by substituting for section 9 the following section: \"Payment 9. On the date of maturity of an investment, or on any date as may otherwise be provided in the terms and conditions of the instrument, such sums as are available for payment on the investment shall be paid in accordance with those terms and conditions.\". Amendment of section 9A"@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2005/2/eng@> .
