<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2005/2/eng@/~cl_12> <https://schema.org/text> "Section 9A of the principal Act is amended by substituting for subsection (5) the following subsection: \"(5) The Bank shall pay to the participating investing institution return on each of its investments standing in its account under subsection (4) on the date the return becomes payable under section 8, and shall pay to such institution each of the investments standing in its account under subsection (4) as provided under section 9.\". Amendment of section 9B"@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2005/2/eng@> .
